  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210131_093306.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"7\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"12\">(28 fotos) Diumenge, de 8 a 13 hores, tenen les millors pastetes&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"11\">a La boutique de la Rosquilleta,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"10\">a la pla&ccedil;a d&#39;Espanya, 5, a Onda</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"9\">. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210131_093233.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"4\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"5\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"6\">I divendres podr&agrave;s trobar pastissos de totes classes, ximets, rosquilletes i m&eacute;s. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/02/IMG_20210205_084755.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\" wfd-id=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\" wfd-id=\"1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"3\">Obert de dilluns a dissabte de 7.15 a 13.30 hores, tamb&eacute; tenen pa de maneres diferents, rotllos de Sant Antoni de l&#39;Alcora, pastissets dol&ccedil;os amb farcits variats, coca de poma</span><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38);\" wfd-id=\"2\">&nbsp;o conserves artesanes.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n"
